link computes accessibility by reading ALREADY-PERSISTED downstream barriers.
Running CLRH now would mark segments accessible that are in fact dammed off, and exit 0.

  persist schema : fresh_default_minimal
  unmodelled blocking dams downstream of CLRH:
    LARL  1200000002                             Grand Coulee Dam (psc 1)
    LARL  aac817e2-9175-4d8c-8b9a-10177622fc62   Hugh Keenleyside Dam (psc 1)
