  model these first, DS-first: LARL, UARL, REVL

Fix — pick one:
  1. Model the downstream WSGs first:
       for w in LARL UARL REVL; do Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R $w <config>; done
  2. Model CLRH now and settle access after they land:
       Rscript data-raw/wsg_recompute_one.R CLRH <config>
  3. Override, if those dams are known passable / remediated / irrelevant.
